{"segs": ["PA_ja_56:0.4", "PA_ja_56:1.1", "PA_ja_56:1.2"], "en": "6. The Kañcanakkhandha Jātaka “The man who, with a joyful heart, is one whose mind is glad;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
